/* Accessibility */
"辅助功能" = "Accessibility";
"未授权 — 「切换隐藏文件」会让 Finder 窗口短暂闪烁" = "Not granted — \"Toggle Hidden Files\" will briefly flicker the Finder window";
"FinderRight 用「辅助功能」权限模拟 Cmd+Shift+. 快捷键，实现 Finder 隐藏文件即时切换（无需重启 Finder）。授权后 Finder 窗口不再闪烁。" = "FinderRight uses Accessibility to simulate the Cmd+Shift+. shortcut for instant hidden-file toggling (without restarting Finder). Once granted, the Finder window stops flickering.";
"打开辅助功能设置…" = "Open Accessibility Settings…";
"1. 点击上方按钮，会跳转到「辅助功能」列表" = "1. Click the button above to jump to the Accessibility list";
"2. 找到 FinderRight 并打开开关；如果列表里没有，点 + 添加 FinderRight.app" = "2. Find FinderRight and turn it on; if it's not listed, click + and add FinderRight.app";
"3. 回到此处点击「重新检测」" = "3. Come back and click \"Re-check\"";
